<title>USA: Winnebago Cty, Wis., won by Hutchinson.</title>
<headline>Winnebago Cty, Wis., won by Hutchinson.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Shockey said it won $1.815 million of Winnebago Cty, Wis., general obligation refunding bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.26 percent.</p>
</text>
